+
+### Task 1: `RowMapper.rowsToObjects` gains an optional-columns parameter
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `apps/salon-portfolio/gas/src/RowMapper.ts`
+- Test: `apps/salon-portfolio/gas/tests/RowMapper.test.ts`
